], "label": "positive", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "positive"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["强烈的阳光照在人物身上，女子身着橘红色黑色配色的赛车服，手扶着跑车方向盘，姿态帅气，方向盘中间的logo是小米汽车标志。她双手轻握方向盘，手臂上贴纸红底白字“小天”，下面一行加粗小字“倾情赞助”，左手（观者视角）指尖叠戴钻戒，右手亦缀闪耀指环；耳畔的挂着黑色的耳麦，朋克风格，强光比。 鹦鹉深绿色的车漆。\n\n黑色秀发盘成低髻，额前碎刘海；神情轻蔑。强烈日光勾勒出她细腻的肌肤与赛车服纹理，驾驶舱的仪器在光影中低调衬景，中控台真皮装饰，整体氛围高贵静谧，跑车熠熠生辉，尽显复古浪漫的贵族气息。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "positive"}, "name": "positive", "label": "positive", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "positive"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Fooocus positive", "title": "手动输入提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [486.6667175292969, 222.80702209472656], "pos": [651.6880493164062, -909.2364501953125], "id": 131, "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "Fooocus positive", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [186], "label": "条件", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "条件"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["画面中，一位年轻中国女模特站在户外，手持一根自拍杆，明亮的双眸。灿烂的笑容。杆上连接着一部智能手机。她身穿一件白色无袖上衣，胸前点缀着蝴蝶结装饰。她的长发飘逸，正微笑着看向手机。背景是一片自然风光，有树木和湛蓝的天空。这根自拍杆采用黑白配色，设计简洁时尚。单反相机拍摄，对焦锐利"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 184, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 197, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [285.6000061035156, 88], "pos": [576.0146484375, 46.806636810302734], "id": 123, "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 39}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "seed", "links": [246], "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"